// Counter Contract - Locking Script
// State: [count] (serialized after OP_RETURN)
//
// This contract verifies the preimage and that the input amount is above
// zero. It does not check the new state: the New State box decides it, so
// "increment" with an unchanged count passes.

// Verify preimage authenticity (OP_PUSH_TX)
checkPreimage

// Extract the input amount and verify it is above zero
dup
extractAmount
0 greaterThan
verify

// Script succeeds. Nothing here or in the chain engine checks the count.
drop
true
